### Create Many Users (Batch)
# @name createManyUsers
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/create-many
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": [
    {
      "firstName": "Alice",
      "lastName": "Smith",
      "email": "alice@example.com",
      "password": "Password123!"
    },
    {
      "firstName": "Bob",
      "lastName": "Johnson",
      "email": "bob@example.com",
      "password": "Password123!"
    }
  ]
}
